<title>UK: Gulf extends offer for Clyde.</title>
<headline>Gulf extends offer for Clyde.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian oil group Gulf Canada Resources Ltd said on Friday it had extended its offer for British oil company Clyde Petroleum Plc until February 4.</p>
<p>The company said it had received acceptances for around 0.17 percent othe offer period it held 1.8 percent and had bought a further 0.1 percent during the offer period.</p>
<p>Gulf launched its bid for Clyde in December last year.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
